<title>USA: CBOE to trade BA Merchant options from March 26.</title>
<headline>CBOE to trade BA Merchant options from March 26.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Wednesday it would trade options on BA Merchant Services Inc from March 16.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options would open with strike prices of 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2 and initial expirations in April, May, July and October.</p>
<p>The stock ended at 14-5/8, up 1/8, on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The CBOE said BA Merchant options would trade in the Coca-Cola Co trading crowd.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
